{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26114","headline":"荐冰 · 鲍溶","name":"荐冰","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"西陵宜先啓，春寒寝庙清。\n历官分气候，天子荐精诚。\n已辨瑶池色，如和玉佩鸣。\n礼余神转肃，曙後月残明。\n雅合霜容洁，非同雪体轻。\n空怜一掬水，珍重此时情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鲍溶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26114.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26114","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}